{% comment %}
  FUEL_05: the homepage UGC video row.

  This is a snippet, not a section, because the homepage template sits at
  Shopify's 25-section cap and nothing new fits without removing client
  content. It is rendered from inside the "Senaste dofterna" popular-products
  section (sections/popular-products.liquid, gated to that one instance), so
  it takes no template slot. Same approach as the collection-page tiles.

  The six clips are the client's uploads (Slack, Aug 26). The sources and
  posters below are Shopify's own transcodes of those Files entries, the same
  URLs the product-page slider serves through its video picks. Hard-coded here
  because a snippet has no settings to hold a video pick. If a clip is ever
  re-uploaded, refresh the URLs from the Files entries.

  Remove this file and its render site with the FUEL_05 cleanup.

  Usage:
  {% render 'fuel05-ugc-home-row' %}
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'fuel05-ugc.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script src="{{ 'fuel05-ugc.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

<div
  class="fuel05-ugc fuel05-ugc--home"
  data-fuel05-row
  data-gap-mobile="10"
  data-gap-desktop="32"
  style="display: none;">
  <div class="fuel05-ugc__inner">
    <div class="fuel05-ugc__header">
      <h2 class="fuel05-ugc__heading">Älskad av tusentals</h2>
      <div class="fuel05-ugc__nav">
        <button class="fuel05-ugc__arrow fuel05-ugc__arrow--prev" type="button" aria-label="Föregående">
          <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12H20M13 19L20 12L13 5" stroke="black" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="fuel05-ugc__arrow fuel05-ugc__arrow--next" type="button" aria-label="Nästa">
          <svg preserveAspectRatio="none" overflow="visible" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12H20M13 19L20 12L13 5" stroke="black" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fuel05-ugc__slider swiper">
      <div class="swiper-wrapper">
        {% render 'fuel05-ugc-tile',
          video_url: 'https://tryscent.co/cdn/shop/videos/c/vp/b58364a24e90479d995c8cc6dc96a73b/b58364a24e90479d995c8cc6dc96a73b.HD-1080p-7.2Mbps-92843392.mp4?v=0',
